the Counter is a set.
this's N is a number.

the Inc is an actor.
this can Bump.
this's Bump does...
    lock Counter...
        the prev is Counter's N.
        Counter's N is prev + 1.
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

Counter's N is 0.

start Inc's Bump as A...
    if A is ok?
        inspect "a".
    or?
start Inc's Bump as B...
    if B is ok?
        inspect "b".
    or?
start Inc's Bump as C...
    if C is ok?
        inspect "c".
    or?

wait until A is ok...
    inspect "wait-a".
wait until B is ok...
    inspect "wait-b".
wait until C is ok...
    inspect "wait-c".

log Counter's N.
